      "writtenOn": "2023-07-20T18:22:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will this workaround ever be able to be removed?\n\nGoing further, why should teams invest in support this feature with arch-specific implementations of `get_panic_stack_pointer()`, if coredumps are coming and will make all of that work unnecessary? How far away is coredump support, and why isn\u0027t that being pursued now instead?",
