      "message": "From \"Google C++ Style Guide\", this may not be used:\n\ngo/cstyle#Other_Features\n\n\u003e The regular expression facilities defined in \u003cregex\u003e because they duplicate existing google3 functionality (RE2).\n\nWe\u0027re supposed to use https://github.com/google/re2 instead.\n\nThere is a link to a C wrapper available at: https://github.com/marcomaggi/cre2/\n\n----\n\nI have other reasons below about why regular expressions are a bad idea in test code, so I think it should be removed for those reasons anyway.",
